WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,780
At this time, can the Miao Dao still move?

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:06,620
The Miao sword does not use wheels, it uses batches for top-down attacks.

3
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:10,660
The bottom-up attack is to lift, the horizontal attack is to sweep, and the forward thrust is to stab.

4
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:13,620
To defend, the hand is raised, but the mace is used with the wheel.

5
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:16,460
If I call you master, can you teach me?

6
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:23,020
What are you thinking? I can teach you without calling you Master

7
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:26,180
But Miao Dao won't give it to you. This thing is not what you should use.

8
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:31,580
The evil spirit is too strong and not suitable for you. Why don't you ask me why?

9
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:36,630
I feel that if I ask, I will know too much and will be silenced.

10
00:00:43,190 --> 00:00:46,910
Pay attention to the regulations after modifying the car, forget it during the special period now

11
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:49,420
Temporary shelter, I will help you apply for it

12
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:52,260
A strong general will arrive soon, and there may be a red prison

13
00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:56,620
Stop the car here first. The terrain is higher. Don't continue walking.

14
00:01:01,050 --> 00:01:04,290
Get on the bus first, it will take a while, I'm afraid I won't be able to queue up the accommodation
